      "card_ids": ["C09"],
      "claim": "In rabbits, dalbavancin-derived radioactivity in CSF was very low (0.08 µg eq/g at 12 h and 0.05 µg eq/g at 24 h), indicating negligible BBB penetration for this closely related lipoglycopeptide.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
